              "desc": "· Rupture specialty Agent Sheer DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases by 15%</color>, and reduces Miasma Shield <color=#2BAD00>30% faster</color>.\n· While in Ether Veil, Agent <color=#FE437E>Ether DMG</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases by 25%</color>, and hitting an enemy makes its Stun DMG Multiplier <color=#2BAD00>increase by 25%</color> for 10s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
