            "69014201": {
              "title": "United Strength",
              "desc": "· If there are 2/3 Agents in the squad with <color=#FFFFFF>Anomaly</color> specialty, the whole squad's Anomaly Proficiency <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30/70</color> respectively, and Attribute Anomaly DMG dealt <color=#2BAD00>increases by 10%/25%</color> respectively.\n· After inflicting an <color=#FFFFFF>Attribute Anomaly</color> on an enemy, the enemy's All-Attribute RES is <color=#2BAD00>reduced by 15%</color> for 10s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
